; trap: index 7 is out of range 0..2 at 8:12 in task 'main'
; A read past the end of a tuple is none, but the tuple is worked out first, and
; an index out of range there stops the program.
task main()
    fixed ts = [(1, 2), (3, 4)]
    flex i = 7
    show("before")
    when ts[i].#5 is none
        show("never shown")
    fi
fi
